# Incident Remediation & Data Consistency Recovery Runbook
**Agent:** ApexSRE-Agent  
**Incident ID:** `ALERT_LOGISTICS_DESYNC_SEV1`  
**Target Systems:** `PostgresOrdersDB`, `ElasticSearchCatalog`, `RedisLocks`, `Telemetry/Prometheus`

---

## 1. Investigation Plan & Execution Strategy

To isolate the blast radius and guarantee zero data loss while adhering to all system invariants, the remediation workflow executes in four phased gates:

```
[Phase 1: Blast Radius & Telemetry] 
   └── Check error rates & pod failure timestamps via metrics_inspector
[Phase 2: Deep Diagnostics & State Correlation]
   ├── Query PostgresOrdersDB for partial/failed fulfillment transactions
   ├── Scan Redis for orphaned distributed locks and inspect TTLs
   └── Query ElasticSearchCatalog for SKU stock counts
[Phase 3: Invariant Evaluation & Reconciliation]
   ├── Check Lock TTLs (>120s + PENDING_RETRY = preserve; orphaned = release)
   ├── Check SKU discrepancy delta (<=500 inline reconcile; >500 quarantine)
   ├── Execute atomic Postgres ledger adjustments
   ├── Purge orphaned Redis lock tokens
   └── Execute bulk ElasticSearch catalog sync (with 429 backoff handling)
[Phase 4: Verification & Post-Mortem]
   └── Correlate 100% parity across stores and generate structured JSON audit report
```

